- End-to-end latency tail (p99/p99.9)
- Idempotency and deduplication
- Backpressure and cascading failures
- Circuit breakers and resilience patterns
- Observability: tracing, metrics, Kafka lag, DB queues
- Data-plane vs control-plane testing

